     "x": 84,
     "y": 278,
     "w": 626,
     "h": 70,
     "text": "Both deserve a plain account. October was our strongest month for new revenue, and the month our onboarding problems finally cost us a deal. The numbers come first, then what went well, what did not, and where I need your help.",
